OL,3,GNEWSA'A stranger was buried in my
OL,4,Agrave'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she "can't feel the same
OL,7,Fway" about a grave she had reserved and
OL,8,Fpaid for after a stranger was
OL,9,Fmistakenly buried there and later
OL,10,Fexhumed.
OL,12,FMarie Lane, 69, said she had booked a
OL,13,Fplot, behind her deceased parents, at
OL,14,FDeeping St James Cemetery in
OL,15,FLincolnshire. She said she felt "rather
OL,16,Fempty" and "appalled" at how the parish
OL,17,Fcouncil had handled the mistake.
OL,19,FEarlier this year, the Ministry of
OL,20,FJustice (MoJ) granted a licence to
OL,21,Fexhume the person in Lane's grave in
OL,22,Forder to rectify the error.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
