OL,3,GNEWSA'A stranger was buried in my
OL,4,Agrave'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeeping St James Parish Council said it
OL,7,F"acknowledges that a mistake was made"
OL,8,Fand apologised "for the distress this
OL,9,Fhas caused both families". It said the
OL,10,Fburial plot had been returned to Lane.
